[C]     [Dm7]       [C]     [Bb2]      [F/A]        [G/B]
{ci: Key up a half step after each verse (up to 3 times)}

{comment: Verse 1}
[C2]Our God is an awesome God   [G/B]Our God is an [F/A]awesome God
[C/E]Our God is an [F2]awesome God   [Bb2]He reigns, [F2]He's an awesome [C2]God
{ci: (repeat)}

{comment: Verse 2}
[C2]He's the one true living God   [G/B]He's the one true [F/A]living God
[C/E]He's the one [F2]true living God   [Bb2]He reigns, [F2]He's an awesome [C2]God
{ci: (repeat)}

{comment: Verse 3}
[C2]No God like Jehovah God   [G/B]No God like [F/A]Jehovah God
[C/E]No God like Je[F2]hovah God   [Bb2]He reigns, [F2]He's an awesome [C2]God
{ci: (repeat)}

