[C2]Angels bow before his throne   [G/B]Angels bow before [F/A]his throne
[C/E]Angels bow be[F2]fore his throne   [Bb2]He reigns  [F2]    He [C2]reigns
{ci: (repeat)}

{comment: Bridge}
[Am7]Alpha,  [C/E]Omega,   [Dm7]Beginning,  the [F2]ending
[Am7]The first, the [C/E]last,  The [Dm7]Lion, The [F2]Lamb
[Bbm7]Mighty, [Db/F]Glorius,  [Ebm7]Powerful,  [Gb2]Omnipotent
[Bbm7]Jehovah,  [Db/F]Adonai,  [Ebm7]Elohim,  El [Gb2]Shaddai,
